 🌟 **Farishton Par Imaan**

📌 Arabic me farishton ko **“Malaika”** kehte hai.
📌 Farishte Allah ki makhlooq hain jo **noor** se bane hue hain aur jinhein hum apni aankhon se nahin dekh sakte.

---

✅ Farishton par Imaan ka Matlab

1️⃣ Unke **wujood** par Imaan lana
2️⃣ Unke **naam** par Imaan lana
3️⃣ Unke **sifaat (qualities)** par Imaan lana
4️⃣ Unke **kaam** par Imaan lana

---

🌙 Farishton ki Khalqat

* Farishte **noor se paida kiye gaye**.
  Hadith: Rasulullah ﷺ ne farmaya:
  “Farishton ko noor se banaya gaya, jinn ko bina dhuen ki aag se aur insaan ko mitti se.”

---

📖 Farishton ka Banaya Jana

* Farishte **insaan se pehle banaye gaye**.
  Qur’an [2:30]: *“Jab Rabb ne farishton se kaha: Main zameen par khalifa banane wala hoon.”*

---

🪽 Farishton ka Size

* Kuch farishte bohot azeem hain.
* Jibraeel (AS) ke **600 par (wings)** the jo poore afaaq ko dhak lete the.
* Arsh uthane wale farishton ke kaan aur kandhe ka faasla **700 saal ke safar** ke barabar hai.

---

🕊️ Farishton ke Par

Qur’an [Faatir:1]: *“Allah ne farishton ko par diye – do, teen ya chaar…”*

---

🔢 Farishton ki Tadaad

* Inki ginati sirf Allah janta hai.
* Har insaan ke saath **do farishte** (kiraman katibeen) hotay hain.
* Bait-ul-Ma’mur par roz **70,000 farishte tawaf** karte hain.
* Lailatul Qadr me farishte **zameen par utarte hain**.

---

🍃 Kya Farishte Khaate Peete Hain?

* Nahi, farishte **na khate hain na peete**.
* Unki ghiza sirf **Allah ki tasbeeh aur ibaadat** hai.

---

 🙌 Farishton ka Zikr o Tasbeeh

Qur’an [21:20]: *“Woh raat din Allah ki tasbeeh karte hain aur kabhi thakte nahi.”*

---

🏠 Farishton ka Ghar

* **Aasman** farishton ka asli ghar hai.
* Allah ke hukm se woh zameen par utarte hain.

---

🌸 Farishton ki Sifaat aur Kaam

✔️ Na mard hain na aurat
✔️ Shaadi ya bache nahi karte
✔️ Insaan ki shakal le sakte hain (jaise Jibraeel AS sahabi Dahiya al-Kalbi ki shakal me aate)
✔️ Pyaaz/lehsan ki boo se takleef mehsoos karte hain
✔️ Allah ke qareeb hain, magar kabhi takabbur nahi karte
✔️ Allah ke khaas bandon ke liye dua karte hain
✔️ Jummah ke din masjid me aane walon ke **naam register** karte hain
✔️ Pasandida zikr: *“SubhanAllahi wa Bihamdihi”*

---

🚫 Farishte Kahan Nahi Hote

❌ Ghanti bajne wali mehfil me
❌ Gandagi wali jagah
❌ Kaafir ki laash ke paas
❌ Sharab/Nasha karne wale ke paas
❌ Jahan kutta ho
❌ Jo sahaba ko bura kahe
❌ Bid’aat phailane walon ke paas
❌ Qatil ko panah denewale ke paas
❌ Wo aurat jo shohar ko bulaane par na aaye

---

🕊️ Mashhoor Farishton ke Naam

1. **Jibraeel (AS)** – Wahi lekar aate
2. **Mikaeel (AS)** – Baarish aur rizq ke zimmedar
3. **Israfeel (AS)** – Qayamat ke din soor phoonkenge
4. **Izraeel (AS)** – Maut ka farishta
5. **Kiram al-Katibeen** – Amaal likhne wale
6. **Malik (AS)** – Jahannum ke daroga
7. **Munkar aur Nakeer (AS)** – Qabar ke sawal karne wale
8. **Ridwan (AS)** – Jannat ke daroga
9. **Haroot aur Maroot (AS)** – Sulaymaan (AS) ke waqt mein bheje gaye

---

✨ **Summary:**
Farishton par imaan rakhna Imaan ke 6 rukn me se ek hai. Hume unke wujood, unke naam, sifaat aur kaamon par yaqeen rakhna hai. Yeh sab Allah ke hukum ke mutii aur sada ibaadat mein masroof hote hain.

